WEBVTT

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.150
I don't like parties either.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.810
Still, well, are you going to keep fighting?

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:57.190
The International Organizational
Army will arrive here soon.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:01.930
They won't hesitate to disintegrate
the city of Tokyo.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.870
There's nobody left in this town now.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:11.170
Please tell me. Who are you going to fight for?

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.400
What are you going to protect
by continuing to fight?

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:16.780
You sure are talkative tonight.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:22.320
Oh, no!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.080
Jeez, I can't believe this man!

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.420
What? Where are Mackey and Nene?

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.520
Mackey...

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.000
Mackey!

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.350
Wait!

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:00.750
Nene!

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:02.360
What is this?

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:04.150
Mackey!

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:09.000
This boy is mine.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.300
A part of me, my prototype.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:14.830
What's going on? What's he talking about?

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.840
Galatea...

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.210
No! Mackey is Mackey!

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:22.180
Come back to me! Give Mackey back to me!

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:24.480
This body is a part of the boomer.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:26.680
It will simply assimilate with the boomer.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:30.140
This body contains too much
data with false settings.

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:31.920
Stop it!

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.220
What the hell is he doing?

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:37.680
She's pushing her own data into his brain.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.160
By deleting his human
information and memories...

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.490
No!

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.290
I'm sorry to make you take on such a silly role.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:11.590
When you start fighting, I'll lose my life.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.420
I'll be right back.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:23.830
I still think Nene should be with Mackey.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.700
If she wants to do that, I won't mind.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.010
You too, Linna.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.420
This battle is between Galatea and me.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.720
The battle where I finish it all,
between me and that monster

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.350
that was born from my brain.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.490
Not a battle as a Knight Saber.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.200
Also, I have nothing left to pay you with.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.630
I...

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:47.820
I'm going.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.330
I'm going to take Mackey's
memory back from Galatea.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.010
See you.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.160
You coward.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:25.800
Priss!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.470
When you come back, it'll
be a better one, right?

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.250
All of you are coming with me?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.360
I was just an ordinary office worker,

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:49.260
and my dream to join the
Knight Sabers came true.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:52.660
I don't mean it's pay back time.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:56.170
Well, I don't understand
what I want to say, but...

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:58.190
We are Knight Sabers.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.000
That's enough.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:04.300
Concealed boomer executioners,
the same as always.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.110
Nene?

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.270
She's right! Well, let's go!

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:13.640
Knight Sabers, Action!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.750
Come home safe.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.890
Don't you die.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.970
What's that fog like stuff?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.340
I think it became thicker all of a sudden.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:47.020
Listen, when we break through
the wall, don't separate!

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:49.350
Inside it's saturated with the phenomenon.

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.490
If we fail to concentrate,
we'll be absorbed by it.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.460
We'll just smash Galatea, right?

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:05.870
Priss!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.070
Priss!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:18.510
This fog is nano-mechanical, a boomer!

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:21.750
I'm going!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:35.130
Damn! We can't move forward, can we?

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:37.620
She's shrewd to protect herself.

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:40.640
Please help me to accelerate.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:43.000
My own thruster doesn't have enough power.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.110
I guess you're right. It's surely not efficient.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.510
But then...

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:57.680
I guess so.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.360
Sylia...

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:07.930
Mackey?

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:15.170
Watch your neck. I'm sure you'll
have a pretty strong backlash.

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:16.140
I'll be all right!

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:22.570
Linna, get away!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:25.140
Linna!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.030
What'll I do?!

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:48.840
Nene!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.910
What is he going to do?

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.340
They're... they're...

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:06.860
Nene.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.020
Mackey!

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.430
Mackey, do you still remember me?

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:16.660
I'm not sure. I can't remember your face, Nene.

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.430
Oh, no...

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:24.840
But I remember that the person called Nene
is a very important person to me.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:32.010
There is some of my own memory left in
the non-volatile area of my mind, but

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.750
it will disappear soon.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.320
Why?!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.950
No! I hate this!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:41.560
What's happening to her?

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:44.220
Mackey? Is Mackey talking to Nene?!

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:48.700
Listen to me, Nene. Currently,
I'm connected to Galatea.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:52.940
I'm going to send my information to Galatea.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:56.240
Memories of me as a human
are irregular data to her.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:09:01.480
She can't understand them, so
she won't know what to do.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:03.310
No! If you do that, you'll...

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:06.480
No! You don't have the power to
do something like that, Mackey!

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.950
What's going on? What is he saying?!

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:13.360
Galatea is an excellent machine.
She'll only be confused a moment.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:16.660
Listen, you have to break through
the hard shield during this.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.000
Mr. Mackey!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.660
No! Don't get close to him!

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:25.970
We have to get out!

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:27.340
But...

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:30.170
He's going to do the best he can to the last.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.270
Why don't you just watch?

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:33.910
Mackey, no! Stop this!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:37.580
Nene, I'm glad I met you. I...

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.140
I'll never, ever forget you!

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.580
Please take care of Sylia.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.970
Goodbye, Nene.

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:30.900
Mackey!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:50.150
Now!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.020
We did it!

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.030
Nene!

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:06.930
Mackey... Mackey is...

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:10.130
What's wrong? What happened to Mackey?!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.770
We don't have time to talk about it.

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:15.040
It's already starting to get hard again.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.010
Sylia!

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:19.410
Mackey!

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:25.350
Mr. Mackey...

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:30.390
Hey, Mackey!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.060
Nene, what happened to Mackey?!

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:43.610
Just now, Mackey used
the last of his power,

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.970
and opened the wall for us.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:49.050
Oh, no...

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:51.680
I... I'm going in!

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:52.710
Nene, wait!

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.420
It's all my fault that Mackey...

00:11:56.420 --> 00:12:00.910
Sylia, you said you'd finish
with Galatea, didn't you?

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:03.420
That's right.

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:20.100
Priss!

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:31.550
What the hell is this?

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:34.720
You don't want to stay alive like this, do you?

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.160
Priss!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:41.890
Please don't. Our enemy is the boomers, isn't it?

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:44.900
I understand.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.870
You've become strong, haven't you, Nene?

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.360
No, not that way.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:52.430
I'm going inside.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.110
Weird...

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.190
My body is floating in here!

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.890
Ultra conductive space, gravity is eliminated.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.410
Galatea!

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.110
Sylia...

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:33.140
Your birth was a mistake.
It was my father's mistake!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.620
I wonder about that.

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:43.860
What the hell is that?!

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:56.900
The phenomenon?! How come
it looks like a living thing?!

00:13:57.840 --> 00:13:59.240
If you touch it...

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.640
Your hard suits will instantly
become mad boomers!

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:04.510
No!

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.380
Oh, no, it has no effect!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.660
Well, there's no choice then.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.390
What are you going to do?!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:27.140
Nene, search for a live power line in this tower.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.470
Roger.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.800
This is what I definitely didn't want to do, but...

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.640
Priss, it's too dangerous!

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:06.440
Nene!

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:10.410
Here it is. This is the only live spot.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.540
I'm going to cascade it there.

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:15.810
Hurry up.

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:22.190
Hurry!

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.360
Sylia, Linna, get away from me!

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.570
Here it is! Priss!

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:38.170
Take this!

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.810
That was disgusting!

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.810
That was a dangerous stunt you just pulled!

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:19.710
I can't believe that you voluntarily
connected with a boomer!

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:22.880
Shut up. We didn't have any other choice.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.380
Where's Sylia?

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:33.520
Galatea...

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.430
Galatea!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.060
Your birth was a mistake

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:42.970
as I said before!

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:47.800
You're also the person who took my father's life!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:52.780
Why do I look like you?

00:16:54.720 --> 00:17:00.320
Even though I was born as
an anti-seed in your brain,

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:04.320
it was only to copy your brain functions.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.630
I'm neither your child nor a clone.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:11.800
That's right, but you came out of my body.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.300
That's why I'm going to wipe you out.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.500
I don't need to stay in this shape.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.640
Neither does anyone else.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.200
What are you talking about?!

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:25.980
There's no need to stay in a place like this.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:30.280
You won't go anywhere. You will stop
your activities forever right here!

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:34.890
Sylia!

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:46.200
Stop that! Use human speech!

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.860
Sylia, are you going to erase me?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:51.830
Mackey!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:57.940
I'm also in here. Boomers are all
connected as one organism.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.570
Mackey!

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:08.860
Boomers were born from you, Sylia.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.420
Therefore, human beings
can also be connected.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:13.800
Why don't you become one with me?

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:17.030
If you do that, you won't suffer.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.100
That's wrong!

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:20.240
What do you mean "wrong", Nene?!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.570
The person talking now is not Mackey!

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:25.610
I know Mackey doesn't talk like that!

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:28.130
Those words are coming from Galatea, Sylia!

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:32.710
Oh, no!

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.450
What are you doing?!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.480
Sylia will be in serious danger
if we let this continue.

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:48.590
You damn monster!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.300
Sylia!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:58.870
I'm so sorry, Mackey.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.810
Sylia, pull yourself together!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.280
What the hell?!

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:19.780
I don't know what's happening!

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:31.100
What's going on?!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:38.510
The tower! This tower is becoming Galatea!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.080
We can't stay here any longer!

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:47.250
The tower? Becoming Galatea?!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.650
Next Episode

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:04.050
The immoral goddess spreads her wings wide,

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.720
and takes the lives of the new age within.

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:11.660
Left outside, the only thing those
of the old age can do is struggle.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:15.400
Galatea has taken off
into the universe.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:18.860
I know it's a little ridiculous, but
only we can reach her.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:21.630
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
